  "FriendlyName": "MomijiUI",
  "Description": "A declarative UI framework for Unreal Engine 5: screens are JSON (nodes, layout, bindings, focus), drawn by a Slate renderer that matches the browser renderer. Bundles BIZ UDP Gothic / Mincho and the conformance fixtures.",
